#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:175
msgid ""
"This appears because average CO₂ per order increased above the efficiency "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Cela apparaît parce que le CO₂ moyen par commande a dépassé le seuil "
"d’efficacité."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:203
msgid ""
"This appears because emissions increased while orders did not grow "
"significantly."
msgstr ""
"Cela semble s’expliquer par une augmentation des émissions alors que les "
"commandes n’ont pas augmenté de manière significative."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:371
msgid ""
"This appears because one emissions driver is above the hotspot risk "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Cela apparaît parce qu’un conducteur d’émissions dépasse le seuil de risque "
"de point chaud."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:396
